{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040030/extras/643a2dca270e79dba6d4253ece61d3b6.webp?t=1760120333\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fifth Bell is a mystical horror adventure inspired by an ancient legend. You are Mark, a folklorist exploring a foggy, eerie village filled with secrets and danger. Hidden throughout the village are five mystical offerings \u2014 each playthrough places them in new, random locations. Find them and place them on the altar to reveal the truth of the legend\u2026 if you can survive the Reaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized offerings \u2013 every run is different, keeping the tension high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless pursuit \u2013 the Reaper hunts you with every toll of the bell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric village \u2013 fog, shadows, and hidden dangers around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided exploration \u2013 a glowing green stick helps you navigate the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival and skill \u2013 quick thinking and speed are your only allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter progression \u2013 after the village, follow the curse into a mysterious city in the second chapter, where danger spreads and challenges grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story \u2013 piece together the legend and discover the fate of those cursed by the Fifth Bell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you gather all the offerings and survive the fifth bell, or will the Reaper claim you first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, the game features 2 chapters that introduce players to the core mechanics and the beginning of the story. Moving forward, based on community feedback and ideas, the narrative will continue to evolve: chapters will be expanded, and new levels and mechanics will be added.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"What do we have here?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4040030/aa33e353dbe7659d772728a69cf47b80ed0868e0.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040030?t=1760120333","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040030?t=1760120333","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040030/ff49ba6f03c53dc2d1a215f1e251bca6c191ff69/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760120333","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040030/ff49ba6f03c53dc2d1a215f1e251bca6c191ff69/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760120333","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040030/extras/643a2dca270e79dba6d4253ece61d3b6.webp?t=1760120333\" width=800 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Fifth Bell is a mystical horror adventure inspired by an ancient legend. You are Mark, a folklorist exploring a foggy, eerie village filled with secrets and danger. Hidden throughout the village are five mystical offerings \u2014 each playthrough places them in new, random locations. Find them and place them on the altar to reveal the truth of the legend\u2026 if you can survive the Reaper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized offerings \u2013 every run is different, keeping the tension high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relentless pursuit \u2013 the Reaper hunts you with every toll of the bell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric village \u2013 fog, shadows, and hidden dangers around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided exploration \u2013 a glowing green stick helps you navigate the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival and skill \u2013 quick thinking and speed are your only allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chapter progression \u2013 after the village, follow the curse into a mysterious city in the second chapter, where danger spreads and challenges grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the story \u2013 piece together the legend and discover the fate of those cursed by the Fifth Bell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you gather all the offerings and survive the fifth bell, or will the Reaper claim you first?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, the game features 2 chapters that introduce players to the core mechanics and the beginning of the story. Moving forward, based on community feedback and ideas, the narrative will continue to evolve: chapters will be expanded, and new levels and mechanics will be added.</p>","developers":["Loop Nexus Games "],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040030/f9e075bebaf2e0b266b074d279452cbeee20caf9/header.jpg?t=1760120333","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4040030/2002986831/0dae97416468f8747203f7164a24f89633e6fb58/1758024144/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758349370","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4040030/2002986831/0dae97416468f8747203f7164a24f89633e6fb58/1758024144/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758349370","